                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Bierlachs is a German social variant of Skat, also known as Beer Skat or Bierlatz. It keeps the 32-card Skat pack and point-trick core but compresses the hand into a short pub-game format where rapid card counting and cooperation matter immediately.',
